{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.50]Yeah (Nash effect)\n[00:09.40]Oh-oh, ooh-oh, oh-oh-oh\n[Chorus]\n[00:12.46]You've been on my mind, since we first met\n[00:17.98]I've been gettin' high, it's a process\n[00:22.56]Heartbreak, girl, we beyond that\n[00:26.80]Just be honest\n[00:30.20]The sorrow and the pain, I can't digest\n[00:34.38]Take my time, got no time left\n[00:38.28]Take my heart, all of my love\n[00:42.24]Just don't waste it\n[00:45.28]I was always scared to go find love\n[00:50.14]Waiting on Cupid to find us\n[00:54.08]Put my life in the hourglass, time up\n[Verse]\n[00:59.74]I just caught feelings for my styrofoam cup\n[01:05.86]Lean put me down, but it's fillin' me up\n[01:09.76]Fallin' to the ground, shit is tearin' me up\n[01:14.20]I'm fucked up\n[01:15.46]I try to pretend I don't care so much\n[01:24.26]But when I wake up, and I see that you're gone\n[01:39.54]Got me doin' drugs, walkin' into my doom\n[01:45.28]Dear, lost love, dear, lost love, dear, lost love\n[02:01.66]Got me doin' drugs, walkin' into my doom\n[02:03.64]Dear, lost love, lost love","words":[[1.5,2.44,"Yeah"],[3.94,4.22,"(Nash"],[6.24,9.36,"effect)"],[9.4,10.36,"Oh-oh,"],[10.46,11.74,"ooh-oh,"],[11.82,12.32,"oh-oh-oh"],[12.46,14.78,"You've"],[14.9,15.12,"been"],[15.26,15.3,"on"],[15.36,15.56,"my"],[15.62,15.76,"mind,"],[16.0,16.24,"since"],[16.42,16.5,"we"],[16.62,17.2,"first"],[17.68,17.84,"met"],[17.98,18.76,"I've"],[18.9,19.06,"been"],[19.16,19.76,"gettin'"],[19.92,20.1,"high,"],[20.2,20.34,"it's"],[20.44,20.44,"a"],[20.58,22.1,"process"],[22.56,23.48,"Heartbreak,"],[23.58,23.8,"girl,"],[24.06,24.16,"we"],[24.3,25.1,"beyond"],[25.58,25.72,"that"],[26.8,27.12,"Just"],[27.2,27.3,"be"],[27.86,29.14,"honest"],[30.2,30.26,"The"],[30.4,31.34,"sorrow"],[31.7,31.9,"and"],[32.1,32.22,"the"],[32.4,32.82,"pain,"],[32.88,32.88,"I"],[32.98,33.32,"can't"],[33.36,33.94,"digest"],[34.38,34.94,"Take"],[35.08,35.18,"my"],[35.34,35.76,"time,"],[35.86,36.04,"got"],[36.22,36.26,"no"],[36.36,36.66,"time"],[3